<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak markets closed on Monday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Slovak markets closed on Monday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak equity and foreign exchange markets are closed on Monday as the country celebrates the &quot;Three Kings&quot; holiday.</p>
<p>All markets are scheduled to re-open for their regular operating hours on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
